OL,3,GNEWSA'Doesn't get better' than working
OL,4,Aon Blue Planet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scientist who was inspired to become
OL,7,Fa marine biologist after watching Blue
OL,8,FPlanet said it was a dream come true to
OL,9,Fwork on the current series.
OL,11,FDr Bryce Stewart, who is a marine
OL,12,Fecologist and fisheries biologist at
OL,13,Fthe University of Plymouth, was a
OL,14,Fscientific consultant on the BBC's Blue
OL,15,FPlanet III series, which is narrated by
OL,16,FSir David Attenborough.
OL,18,FStewart said watching the first series
OL,19,Fof the natural history documentary in
OL,20,F2001 had played a big part in his
OL,21,Fdesire to become a marine scientist.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
